      <div class="" id="">
        <h4><span>Cupping Notes</span></h4>
<p><span>Medium body, rich with layered notes of caramelized sugar, chocolate and a hint of bergamot.</span></p>
<h4><span>Bio</span></h4>
<p><span>What can anyone say about their espresso blend. &nbsp;It's a secret! &nbsp;The goal was to create an espresso that given the opportunity could tell a short "flavor story" or settle into some steamed milk with ease. &nbsp;If you want to try something extra fun, brew it up as a pourover!</span></p>
        <!-- snippet location product_description -->
