                        <p>When you place your order with us, we roast your coffee within minutes. <strong>How's that for fresh?</strong></p>
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="list-items">
                <div class="item-holder">
                    <div class="heading">
                        <h3>Sealed Tight</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item-description">
                        <p>We package your beans using a one way valve bag, ensuring the <strong>freshest</strong> product upon arrival.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </li>
            
            <li class="list-items">
                <div class="item-holder">
